# tests/tree-map, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating this
# directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST. Every assertion is about a run's RESULT, and dispatching a run
# is what a worker does with `curry` + `run-then`. `treemap` resolves to the
# built worker; `level` is the per-directory worker it is given as `run`; `tree`
# is the fixture it walks.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash --worker1:@=worker.sh --treemap:@=DEEP-DEPS/tree-map --level:@=level --tree:@=tree
